  (link(<t-netn-ProbabilityHazardContourGroup>)[#"Probability​Hazard​Contour​Group"], "Represents the footprint covered by a CBRN hazard. This object covers the agent-specific effects which would be the output from a casualty model.", <t-netn-ProbabilityHazardContourGroup>),
